= Left-wing Split!

Spitting in the face if reason, a handful of significant left profiles have engineered a split to form a new party! These traitors have taken to calling them selves 'Oprigtige Socialdemokrater' (Actual Socialdemocrats), or 'OS'. A ridiculous name.

On a positive note this has scraped off a good chunk of our most uppity left-wing members.

